Subject: [PATCH] Add one-sheet composer: multi-platform publish/schedule in 2
 clicks
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- New ComposerSheet: caption editing, media preview, platform checkboxes
  with live connection status, pre-publish checklist driven by the shared
  social-limits helpers (IG-needs-image blocker; X/LinkedIn/Threads
  overflow explained BEFORE the click), post-now or schedule with a
  per-platform queue entry, last platform selection remembered
- Studio: 'Publish…' on the auto-saved draft opens the composer inline —
  generate -> publish without leaving the page
- Library: one primary 'Publish / Schedule' action per card (legacy
  per-platform dialogs untouched for now)
- Sequential multi-platform publishing with per-platform outcome reporting;
  partial failures never hide successes
- Frontend-only: no API, schema, or contract changes
- Tests: 6 composer tests (gating, multi-publish, IG blocker, caption
  save + thread warning, scheduling, partial failure)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
